commit d1d7c39dfad82dea744baee58b3b6ade7982680c
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:00:43 2026 +0330

    feat(qa4-SEC,qa4-E0): security hardening + /health/version
    
    QA4 security findings, all verified and fixed in configuration/settings.py:
    - SECRET_KEY: insecure hardcoded fallback only allowed when DEBUG;
      fail-fast ImproperlyConfigured otherwise (L41-50)
    - DEBUG defaults OFF (was ON, L35)
    - CORS_ALLOW_ALL_ORIGINS only in DEBUG; CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS env
      whitelist otherwise (L64-75)
    - REST_FRAMEWORK: DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES IsAuthenticated,
      Anon/User throttles (60/min, 600/min), auth scope 10/min,
      ai_heavy 60/hour, EXCEPTION_HANDLER qa_exception_handler (L219-232)
    - SIMPLE_JWT REFRESH_TOKEN_LIFETIME 1d -> 7d (single-use rotation
      locked users out; QA critical P0) (L268)
    - authentication/views.py: ScopedRateThrottle(auth) on login/refresh/
      register/google login + explicit AllowAny on public-by-design views
    - /health/version (plain Django view, public) exposes
      {version, commit, build_at} for deployment verification (E0)
    - .env.example documents the required env vars
    - authentication/tests_qa4_security.py: 4 tests (401 default, 429
      auth throttle, health keys, public health)

